License: OFL-1.1 and Apache-2.0 and CC-BY-4.0 and MIT and Unlicense
Comment:
 Each shipped .ttf is a single compiled file aggregating glyphs from all of
 the sources above under their own licenses; no one license covers the
 whole binary. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for which codepoint ranges come
 from which source and under which of the licenses named above.

Files: debian/*
Copyright: 2026 Jeeyong Um <me@um.je>
License: Apache-2.0
Comment:
 Matches the license this repository uses for its build tooling and
 documentation (see the root LICENSE file, not shipped in this binary
 package).

License: OFL-1.1
Comment:
 Applies to the Latin base (Iosevka Term Nerd Font Mono / Iosevka source),
 the CJK glyphs (Pretendard JP), the eighteen CJK bracket forms (M PLUS
 1p), the enclosed/squared CJK blocks and archaic jamo (Noto Sans KR /
 Source Han Sans), and two of the bundled icon sets (Weather Icons,
 Pomicons). Also the root license of the shipped Harena Term family
 itself, a Reserved Font Name.
 .
